14.114" end="00:14.352">can't </span><span begin="00:14.352" end="00:14.626">get </span><span begin="00:14.626" end="00:14.947">these </span><span begin="00:14.947" end="00:16.325">memories </span><span begin="00:16.325" end="00:17.134">out </span><span begin="00:17.134" end="00:17.389">of </span><span begin="00:17.389" end="00:17.638">my </span><span begin="00:17.638" end="00:19.407">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.920" end="00:28.479"><span begin="00:19.920" end="00:20.197">And </span><span begin="00:20.197" end="00:21.018">some </span><span begin="00:21.018" end="00:21.424">kind </span><span begin="00:21.424" end="00:21.691">of </span><span begin="00:21.691" end="00:24.646">madness </span><span begin="00:24.646" end="00:25.112">has </span><span begin="00:25.112" end="00:25.812">started </span><span begin="00:25.812" end="00:26.324">to </span><span begin="00:26.324" end="00:28.479">evolve</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.694" end="00:40.201"><span begin="00:31.694" end="00:31.899">And </span><span begin="00:31.899" end="00:32.832">I  </span><span begin="00:34.799" end="00:35.042">I </span><span begin="00:35.042" end="00:35.353">tried </span><span begin="00:35.353" end="00:35.650">so </span><span begin="00:35.650" end="00:36.139">hard </span><span begin="00:36.139" end="00:36.877">to </span><span begin="00:36.877" end="00:37.431">let </span><span begin="00:37.431" end="00:37.913">you </span><span begin="00:37.913" end="00:40.201">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.643" end="00:49.317"><span begin="00:40.643" end="00:40.902">But </span><span begin="00:40.902" end="00:41.850">some </span><span begin="00:41.850" end="00:42.213">kind </span><span begin="00:42.213" end="00:42.641">of </span><span begin="00:42.641" end="00:45.707">madness </span><span begin="00:45.707" end="00:46.019">is </span><span begin="00:46.019" end="00:46.699">swallowing </span><span begin="00:46.699" end="00:47.007">me </span><span begin="00:47.007" end="00:48.440">